[{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_99_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_99_0010","text":"谢谢大家──\n我们是noctchill"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_99_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_99_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_99_0020","text":"啊哈～\n只有制作人在鼓掌～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_99_0008","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_99_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_99_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_99_0030","text":"──大家，辛苦了，做得很好！\n我觉得非常棒！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_99_0040","text":"嗯～！\n雏菜也这么觉得～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_99_0050","text":"我也觉得，很棒……！\n──对吧，透同学！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_99_0060","text":"那，走吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_99_0070","text":"————诶？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_99_0080","text":"呵呵，海\n我们到海边来了呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_99_0015","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_99_0090","text":"透，透……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_99_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_99_0100","text":"啊哈～\n雏菜也去～～～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_99_0012","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_99_0110","text":"咇诶……！\n等、等等等等我也……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_99_0121","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_99_0130","text":"喂──\n别看烟花了，看这边──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_99_0140","text":"看这边——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_99_0150","text":"……！\n看、看这边──……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_99_0019","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_99_0170","text":"最近很开心\n像这样在一起────谢谢你"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_99_0006","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_99_0180","text":"我啊，就只有这个了\n理由什么的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_99_0014","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_99_0190","text":"……哈哈\n────嗯……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_99_0200","text":"该怎么表达才好呢……\n这种美丽的东西"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_99_0211","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_99_0220","text":"烟花，你个笨蛋──！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_99_0230","text":"烟、烟花，你个笨蛋──！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_99_0231","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_99_0240","text":"她们还只是高中生啊……\n不必满脑子只想着那些条条框框"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06010000_99_0250","text":"我不会让你们后悔的，\n我会努力的──一定"}]
